SRR2056466	PRJNA286127	SRP059249	SAMN03765184	SRX1053710	Homo sapiens	first round replicate 1	first round replicate 1	Illumina MiSeq sequencing: GSM1706452: first round replicate 1 Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina MiSeq	Genomic DNA was extracted from the surviving cells using DNeasy Blood and Tissue Kit (QIAGEN) The library construction follows Illumina’s TruSeq method. Briefly, sgRNA sequences were amplified by nested PCR with the first pair of primers, GATAGGCTTGGATTTCTATAAG (forward) and CTGCTGGAATCTCGTGAAG (reverse), followed by amplification with the second pair of primers, AATGATACGGCGACCACCGAGATCTACACTCTTTCCCTACACGACGCTCTTCCGATCTNNNNNCTTGGAGAAAAGCCTTGTT (forward) and CAAGCAGAAGACGGCATACGAGATXXXXXXGTGACTGGAGTTCAGACGTGTGCTCTTCCGATCGCTATTTCTAGCTCTAAAAC (reverse, where XXXXXX indicates index sequences). The indexes for first round screen are: replicate1: CAGATC replicate2: TGCTCA replicate3: CAGTAG. For the second round screen, the indexes are: replicate1: GCTGAT replicate2: CTGAGT replicate3: TCGACT.	6150031	461192139	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR205/006/SRR2056466/SRR2056466.fastq.gz	b13c230ebf2c181fcb706d70a73ab72e	232808949
